File_Func_List: uniform (buf,size) handler signature (wasm call_indirect type-check)

The asset dispatch `(*(code*)(&File_Func_List)[type>>3])(buf,size)` pushes TWO args for
every handler (x86 truth); Ghidra declared Load_Cluts/FUN_00415508 with one parameter,
which is harmless natively (cdecl caller cleanup) but a fatal signature mismatch under
WASM's typed call_indirect. Give the 1-arg handlers an ignored size parameter and type
the call through int(*)(int,int). No behavior change natively; unblocks the WASM target
past FUN_004151b0 (asset loading).

